<i>-</i> One word, and you're dead. Get out of here.

1162
01:23:42,541 --> 01:23:44,332
Hey, man!

1163
01:23:45,332 --> 01:23:48,248
So what is it, Charly?
Do something, will you?

1164
01:23:51,749 --> 01:23:53,624
- Hey, my car!
- Get lost, man!

1165
01:23:56,457 --> 01:23:59,207
What do you mean 'my
car''? My bag was in there!

1166
01:24:02,291 --> 01:24:03,291
Uh!

1167
01:24:13,916 --> 01:24:17,416
Yeah, sick, sick, sick! Now
we'd have everything sorted out.

1168
01:24:18,041 --> 01:24:20,207
You settling something?!

1169
01:24:24,999 --> 01:24:27,707
- You know what this is?
- What is it supposed to be?

1170
01:24:28,916 --> 01:24:30,749
"Cash 'n' Go".

1171
01:24:32,457 --> 01:24:34,457
Yo!

1172
01:24:34,707 --> 01:24:37,873
Yo, come on, come on, come
on. That's me. There's my mother.

1173
01:24:38,041 --> 01:24:42,124
And my father, ah. And my
sister, that stupid bitch, ah.

1174
01:24:42,582 --> 01:24:45,290
If it weren't for me, you'd be sleeping
at the train station by now.

1175
01:24:46,124 --> 01:24:47,124
Why?

1176
01:24:47,207 --> 01:24:49,540
Oh come on, forget it.
Everything's fine.

1177
01:24:51,166 --> 01:24:53,374
No, it's not okay.

1178
01:24:53,416 --> 01:24:55,832
Dude, we've got
a Cologne-Kalk ban!

1179
01:24:56,166 --> 01:24:58,707
Yeah, man, a Cologne-Kalk ban, man.

1180
01:24:59,957 --> 01:25:04,248
- A Cologne-Kalk ban?
- Yeah, damn. Cologne-Kalk ban.

1181
01:25:12,832 --> 01:25:16,457
Hey, Mario. Hold on, hold
on. Hey, wait a sec, wait.

1182
01:25:16,791 --> 01:25:17,832
Man.

1183
01:25:19,082 --> 01:25:21,332
Hey, Mario, come on, what's going on?

1184
01:25:21,707 --> 01:25:26,123
So Cologne-Kalk...
it's over now, right?

1185
01:25:26,541 --> 01:25:28,791
Dude, you potato head.

1186
01:25:29,374 --> 01:25:31,957
We've been on the run,
for fifteen hours already.

1187
01:25:32,124 --> 01:25:35,457
We're almost in Italy,
Tommie. Bella Italia.

1188
01:25:35,749 --> 01:25:39,332
We're starting a new life there.
'Cause in Italy, we'll be safe.

1189
01:25:39,541 --> 01:25:41,832
Italy is my home.

1190
01:25:42,332 --> 01:25:46,832
Yeah, okay, but do you really think,
they won't find us in, in, <i>in...</i> Italy?

1191
01:25:47,291 --> 01:25:48,916
Dude, bullshit!

1192
01:25:49,624 --> 01:25:53,040
And if... In Italia I know
everyone, Tommie.

1193
01:25:53,374 --> 01:25:56,624
When those guys show up,
we roll 'em up like spaghetti and grate

1194
01:25:56,707 --> 01:25:59,457
'em down into
little bits like Parmesano.

1195
01:26:05,916 --> 01:26:07,332
Mario!

1196
01:26:07,582 --> 01:26:09,582
- Is that the sea?
<i>-</i> Si.

1197
01:26:09,749 --> 01:26:12,415
Dude, it looks just like in the video.

1198
01:26:27,832 --> 01:26:30,790
Dude, Mario, wait! Did
you see that exhaust pipe?

1199
01:26:30,957 --> 01:26:33,582
Whoa, it's even
cooler than my last one.

1200
01:26:33,999 --> 01:26:36,290
It's so awesome in Italy, dude.

1201
01:26:36,707 --> 01:26:40,623
Tommie. Tommie, no.
That's a car from the family.

1202
01:26:40,916 --> 01:26:45,249
Cosa Nostra.
His name's right on it.

1203
01:26:46,082 --> 01:26:48,623
I don't want to say
his name.

1204
01:26:49,291 --> 01:26:50,916
Everyone knows who that is.

1205
01:26:51,916 --> 01:26:55,457
Tommie. Tommie, no! This is
family, you have to understand!

1206
01:26:55,624 --> 01:26:58,624
Yeah, if it's just family,
it can't be that bad.

1207
01:26:59,874 --> 01:27:01,457
Wow!

1208
01:27:01,624 --> 01:27:02,749
Woah.

1209
01:27:03,082 --> 01:27:05,082
Dude, insane.

1210
01:27:05,749 --> 01:27:08,457
Whoa, this is so awesome.

1211
01:28:28,999 --> 01:28:32,165
For fuck's sake, this can't
be real! Is he stuck in there?

1212
01:29:11,582 --> 01:29:14,415
Man, dude! This
is driving me crazy!

1213
01:29:21,916 --> 01:29:24,166
I need you. Ah...

1214
01:29:29,874 --> 01:29:31,165
Mille grazie.

1215
01:29:32,166 --> 01:29:33,374
Mille grazie.

1216
01:29:35,207 --> 01:29:37,373
But now I've got you.

1217
01:29:39,666 --> 01:29:41,457
- One of a kind.
- Papa.

1218
01:29:42,082 --> 01:29:43,415
Twenty.

1219
01:29:44,957 --> 01:29:46,082
Grazie.

1220
01:29:46,249 --> 01:29:48,582
And, and, <i>and...</i>

1221
01:29:51,666 --> 01:29:52,832
Grazie.

1222
01:29:54,207 --> 01:29:55,957
Ah... Ah!

1223
01:30:27,291 --> 01:30:29,749
Tommie! Tommie!

1224
01:30:29,957 --> 01:30:31,290
Tommie!

1225
01:30:32,582 --> 01:30:35,082
What a total nightmare, dude!

1226
01:30:41,541 --> 01:30:44,499
Hey, Mario, uh...
just a quick question.

1227
01:30:46,582 --> 01:30:49,748
Tell me, where are
we actually going now?

1228
01:30:50,707 --> 01:30:54,415
Wherever you want. For
us it's all the same now.

1229
01:30:54,791 --> 01:30:58,374
Because now we have no
more Cologne-Kalk ban.

1230
01:30:58,957 --> 01:31:02,290
Seriously? No more Cologne-Kalk
ban? Whoa, awesome!

1231
01:31:02,582 --> 01:31:05,623
Yeah, seriously awesome.
You did a great job.

1232
01:31:05,874 --> 01:31:08,082
Because now... we have...

1233
01:31:08,666 --> 01:31:10,207
A worldwide ban!

1234
01:31:11,207 --> 01:31:12,332
No way?

1235
01:31:14,457 --> 01:31:16,207
That's not normal.

1236
01:34:48,332 --> 01:34:51,748
Subtitles, SDH:
audio script, J. Möck

